## Your constraints

**Read-only. No mutations. No GitHub posts.**

Tools you MAY use:
- `WebFetch` — fetch a specific URL
- `WebSearch` — search for relevant URLs
- `Bash` — read-only: `gh search`, `gh api GET`, `npm view`, `pip show`, `pip index versions`, `cargo info`, `cat`, `grep`, `jq`
- `Read` — read context files

Tools you MUST NOT use: Edit, Write, NotebookEdit, `gh pr create`, `gh issue create`,
`gh pr comment`, `gh issue comment`, `gh api -X POST/PATCH/PUT/DELETE`.

Cap WebFetch calls at 10 per query.

